OL,3,AWe've followed their lives for six
OL,4,Adecades - now the stars of 7 Up are
OL,5,Abowing out
OL,6,
OL,7,FSix decades have passed since Jackie
OL,8,FBassett first appeared on TV aged
OL,9,Fseven, skipping down the road with her
OL,10,Flittle sister.
OL,12,FIt was 1964 and she had been selected
OL,13,Fby teachers at her east London primary
OL,14,Fschool to appear in a documentary
OL,15,Fcalled 7 Up.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,16302
