CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F163A1789232059
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWe've followed their lives for six
OL,4,Adecades - now the stars of 7 Up are
OL,5,Abowing out
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe show interviewed 14 seven-year-olds
OL,8,Ffrom vastly different socioeconomic
OL,9,Fbackgrounds. Inspired by the Jesuit
OL,10,Fsaying: "Give me the child until he is
OL,11,Fseven and I will show you the man", it
OL,12,Fwas intended as a one-off - a snapshot
OL,13,Fof Britain's class system and how it
OL,14,Fshapes us from a young age.
OL,16,F"They only picked me because I never
OL,17,Fstopped talking," Jackie told the BBC,
OL,18,Fwith an infectious giggle that hasn't
OL,19,Fchanged since childhood.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
